Everything else under src/ is original to this package: the reviewer-route
storage/API/validation modules and the reviewer-picker React components, with
their stylesheets.

Modifications: the review request carries the session id and the session's
reasoning effort, adds a configurable fallback reasoning level, adds a
session-scoped reviewer route with a client picker (stored in a storage domain,
one record per session, never as a session event), and shadows the permission
slot to host that picker.
